[h1]Idrinth Thalui: Czech / Čeština[/h1]

This language pack provides Czech translations for the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2927955021]Idrinth Thalui[/url] mod.

[h2]Requirements[/h2]

[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2927955021]Idrinth Thalui: The Knight-Scholar[/url] (main mod)
[/list]

[h2]Installation[/h2]

Subscribe to both this language pack and the main mod. The game will automatically use the translations when your game language is set to Czech.

[h2]Contributing[/h2]

Want to help improve the translation? Join our [url=https://crowdin.com/project/idrinth-thalui/invite?h=e154f2cc138e3ad109516051cdd96edf2662006]Crowdin project[/url] to contribute!

[h2]Support[/h2]

For issues or discussion, visit our [url=https://discord.gg/idrinth]Discord[/url] or report bugs on [url=https://github.com/Idrinth/tw-idrinth]GitHub[/url].
